+
+## Limitations / open obligations
+
+- Not law, not deployed, not reviewed by an independent party. No claim that
+  foresight is repaired; the live held row `r1795595445-NZIjZE34` was not read
+  or touched.
+- A fresh foresight appointment with new instructions and the no-replay
+  acceptance item require lawful Executive action after enactment; they are
+  outside this code candidate and are not asserted here.
+- The trust boundary is the `antonina agent status` instrument; the command
+  re-reads it but cannot independently prove the runtime's integrity.
+- The pre-existing `knowledge-budget-negative-20261122.sh` T8 config mismatch
+  is left unchanged (out of scope); it should be tracked separately.
+
+No production ledger, activation, permit, attestation, board, budget state,
+credential, live agent or external side effect was created, edited or replayed
+by this work.
